<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P confirms Thomson SA debt ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P confirms Thomson SA debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it confirmed its &quot;A-&quot; corporate credit, senior unsecured and &quot;A-2&quot; commercial paper ratings of Thomson SA and units and removed them from Creditwatch.</p>
<p>In a statement the ratings agency said the results of Sunday's parliamentary election sharply reduced the likelihood that Thomson-SA or its Thomson-CSF unit would be privatised in the short-term.</p>
</text>
